+# Statsmodels Optional Dependency
+
+The GLMMEncoder requires statsmodels as an optional dependency. 
+
+To use GLMMEncoder, please install statsmodels separately:
+
+```bash
+pip install statsmodels
+```
+
+When statsmodels is not installed, GLMMEncoder will raise an informative ImportError when you try to use it.
